      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَقَأٌ</span></b>  <i>A protuberance,</i> or <i>swelling out,</i> (O, TA,)
<i>of the back,</i> (O,) or <i>of the breast,</i> or <i>chest.</i> (TA.)
[But see 4, and see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْقَأُ</span>.]

